#Post-RPSBLAST Processing Utility

#Input data file:	arch/x_mstate.xml
#Output data file:	(stdout)
#Annotation data at:	sites
#E-Value cutoff:	0.01
#Redundancy:	Full
#Data requested:	Site annotations
#Output format -- tab-delimited table
#Show superfamilies: NO
#DATA
#SESSION	<session-ordinal>	<program>	<database>	<score-matrix>	<evalue-threshold>
#QUERY	<query-id>	<seq-type>	<seq-length>	<definition-line>
#SITES
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<annot-type>	<title>	<residue(coordinates)>	<complete-size>	<mapped-size>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDSITES
#MOTIFS
#<session-ordinal>	<query-id[readingframe]>	<title>	<from>	<to>	<source-domain>
#more such lines......
#ENDMOTIFS
#ENDQUERY	<query-id>
#more query sections..
#ENDSESSION	<session-ordinal>
#more session sections..
#ENDDATA
#=====================================================================
DATA
SESSION	1	RPSBLAST 2.17.0+	Cdd	BLOSUM62	0.01
QUERY	Query_1	Peptide	158	NP_414781.1 RadC-like JAB domain-containing protein YkfG [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_1	Specific	Zn binding site	H107,H109,D120	3	3	501540
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_2	Peptide	148	NP_416506.1 RadC-like JAB domain-containing protein YeeS [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_2	Specific	Zn binding site	H97,H99,D110	3	3	501540
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
QUERY	Query_3	Peptide	185	NP_416542.1 dTDP-4-dehydrorhamnose 3,5-epimerase [Escherichia coli str. K-12 substr. MG1655]
SITES
1	Query_3	Specific	active site	N49,S51,H62,Q64,K72,H119,Y132,D169	8	8	380337
1	Query_3	Specific	homodimer interface	R23,G24,F25,F26,Y27,E28,S29,F30,N31,S33,Q47,D48,N49,H50,S51,R52,S53,S54,V57,R59,T77,K133,Y137,S166	24	24	380337
ENDSITES
ENDQUERY
ENDSESSION	1
ENDDATA
